<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Christ calling yet! shall I not rise?</l><l>Can I His loving voice despise,</l><l>And basely His kind care repay?</l><l>He calls me still; can I delay?</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Christ calling yet! and shall He knock,</l><l>And I my heart the closer lock?</l><l>He still is waiting to receive;</l><l>And shall I dare His Spirit grieve?</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Christ calling yet! and shall I give</l><l>No heed, but still in bondage live?</l><l>I wait, but He does not forsake:</l><l>He calls me still; my heart, awake!</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Christ calling yet! I cannot stay;</l><l>My heart I yield without delay;</l><l>Vain world, farewell! from thee I part;</l><l>The voice of Christ has reached my heart.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
